WHAT YOU MAY DO
    Run Key-J on any number of machines you own or control.
    Use anything you create with it - recordings, exports, sequences -
    for any purpose, commercial or otherwise, with no obligation to
    F-Keys Creative LLC. Your music is yours.
    Read this source. It is published so that a program which installs a
    global keyboard hook can be audited by the people running it.

