WHY IT IS READABLE BUT NOT FREE
    Key-J installs a global keyboard hook. Nobody should be asked to trust
    that blindly, so the source stays readable and auditable. Readable is
    not the same as licensed: you are welcome to check what it does, and
    not to ship it as your own.

